  "question": {
    "text": "If the displacement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>)</mo></math> of a particle executing SHM are related through the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. If the time period of the particle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></math>, then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>?&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br />Differentiating both sides, we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mtext>&#160;acceleration&#160;</mtext><mtext>&#160;displacement&#160;</mtext></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mn>12</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p>"
  }
